hipfire-git - AUR Package README

This package installs the hipfire inference framework.
The `hipfire` command is a wrapper that sets HIPFIRE_DAEMON_BIN and
HIPFIRE_TUI_BIN to the packaged binaries in /usr/lib/hipfire/, then runs
the real CLI. Export either variable yourself to override.

State is stored per user in ~/.hipfire (models, config.toml, registry cache)
and ~/.hipfire_kernels (compiled GPU kernels).

Notes:
- `hipfire setup` and `hipfire update` are source-checkout installers. They
  are not needed for this package, and running them can place a second
  daemon in ~/.hipfire/bin, which takes priority over the packaged one.
- `hipfire serve` listens on 0.0.0.0:11435 by default.
- On Btrfs, consider `chattr +C ~/.hipfire/models` on an empty directory
  before downloading models, to avoid Copy-on-Write overhead.
